o a victim's house, typically a house in a rural area, and stalk them until they are most vulnerable. \n\n(To get out of bed press the B Button or Secondary Button)", "short_description": "Scary Lairy VR is a short horror game based around the being called Scary Lairy. Scary Lairy will go to a victim's house, typically a house in a rural area, and stalk them until they are most vulnerable.\n\n(To get out of bed press the B Button or Secondary Button)"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scary-lairy-privacy-policy/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Nimaple", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/scary-lairy-privacy-policy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1685852365201697"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "213161494778010"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "213161494778010"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1683649753, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "213161494778010"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "5903671003088349", "version": "0.1.2"}, "id": "131401886585018", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": fal